== Tips ==
*'''Ender Pearls''' can be used to obtain some [[Fairy Souls]] more easily.

== Trivia ==
*The death message when a player dies to Endermen angered by throwing Ender Pearls is simply "[player] died".
* In the minion, the pearls will stack to 64. However, when collected into the inventory, the pearls will be placed in stacks of 16. This may result in the inventory getting clogged up when collecting from the [[Enderman Minion]]s, since each stack of pearls in the minion takes up 4 slots in the inventory. However, this causes the minion to have more storage.

